OL,3,GNEWSABeachgoers warned against swimming
OL,4,Aafter pollution alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to a North Yorkshire beach
OL,7,Fhave been warned not to swim in the sea
OL,8,Ffollowing a sewage spill, with one
OL,9,Fswimmer claiming he saw what he
OL,10,Fbelieved to be human waste floating in
OL,11,Fthe water.
OL,13,FA "Do Not Swim" notice was put in place
OL,14,Fat Filey Beach on Saturday.
OL,16,FRobert Forber, who lives nearby, said
OL,17,Fhe had gone for his usual morning swim
OL,18,Fwhen he noticed debris drifting across
OL,19,Fthe bay, claiming "it was faecal
OL,20,Fmatter".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
