OL,3,GNEWSABeachgoers warned against swimming
OL,4,Aafter pollution alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said it was aware a
OL,7,F"pollution risk forecast" had been
OL,8,Fissued and confirmed it discharged from
OL,9,Fa storm overflow on Friday after recent
OL,10,Fheavy rainfall left the sewer network
OL,11,Fat capacity.
